{"id":2233,"date":"2024-09-19T12:31:47","date_gmt":"2024-09-19T12:31:47","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/?post_type=product&#038;p=2233"},"modified":"2025-10-03T13:25:38","modified_gmt":"2025-10-03T13:25:38","slug":"blank-cardboard-boxes","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/blank-cardboard-boxes\/","title":{"rendered":"Blank Cardboard Boxes"},"content":{"rendered":"<h1 data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"70\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"70\">Blank Cardboard Boxes for Packaging &amp; Custom Branding<\/strong><\/h1>\n<p data-start=\"72\" data-end=\"393\">Blank packaging offers flexibility for a wide range of product types. At <a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/\"><em data-start=\"145\" data-end=\"167\">Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/em><\/a>, we supply <strong data-start=\"179\" data-end=\"211\">custom blank cardboard boxes<\/strong> at wholesale prices. Whether you need plain kraft boxes for DIY printing or white cardboard boxes for retail use, we offer durable, high-quality packaging ready for use or branding.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"395\" data-end=\"698\">Our boxes are made using recyclable paperboard and available in multiple strengths, including single wall and double wall. You can choose from tuck-end, mailer, two-piece, or folding designs depending on your application. We also provide options for custom sizes, surface coatings, and internal inserts.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"700\" data-end=\"703\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"705\" data-end=\"756\">Benefits of Blank Cardboard Boxes for Businesses<\/h2>\n<h3 data-start=\"758\" data-end=\"816\">Simple, Cost-Effective Packaging with Custom Potential<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"1002\">Blank cardboard boxes are widely used by retailers, shipping services, startups, and crafters. Their clean surface allows for labeling, stamping, printing, or leaving completely plain.<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"1004\" data-end=\"1174\">\n<li data-start=\"1004\" data-end=\"1049\">\n<p data-start=\"1006\" data-end=\"1049\">Suitable for shipping, storage, and display<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1050\" data-end=\"1094\">\n<p data-start=\"1052\" data-end=\"1094\">Accepts labels, barcodes, or custom stamps<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1095\" data-end=\"1136\">\n<p data-start=\"1097\" data-end=\"1136\">Reduces branding cost for small batches<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1174\">\n<p data-start=\"1139\" data-end=\"1174\">Ships flat or assembled as required<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"1176\" data-end=\"1313\">Whether you are shipping books, selling handmade items, or preparing product kits, blank packaging makes fulfillment fast and affordable.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"1315\" data-end=\"1318\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"1320\" data-end=\"1361\">Material Options and Finishing Choices<\/h2>\n<h3 data-start=\"1363\" data-end=\"1403\">Strong and Eco-Friendly Construction<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"1405\" data-end=\"1560\">All of our blank cardboard boxes are manufactured using food-safe and recyclable materials. Choose the strength and finish that suits your product&#8217;s needs.<\/p>\n<div class=\"_tableContainer_80l1q_1\">\n<div class=\"_tableWrapper_80l1q_14 group flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Features<\/th>\n<th><strong>Available Options<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Material Options<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Finishing Choices<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Add-ons &amp; Features<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Usage\/Application<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Material Types<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Kraft, White SBS, Recycled Cardboard, Corrugated Cardboard, Virgin Paperboard, Duplex Board<\/td>\n<td>FSC-Certified, Food-Grade, Coated Board, Eco-Friendly<\/td>\n<td>Gloss, Matte, Soft Touch, Aqueous, Anti-Scratch<\/td>\n<td>Biodegradable inks, Water-based coatings<\/td>\n<td>Food packaging, Retail boxes, Subscription boxes<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Thickness Range<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>14pt, 16pt, 18pt, 20pt, 24pt, 28pt, 32pt, Double Wall Flute, Triple Wall Flute<\/td>\n<td>C1S, C2S, E-Flute, B-Flute, Double Wall, Triple Wall<\/td>\n<td>Matte Lamination, UV Coating, Soft Touch Lamination<\/td>\n<td>Reinforced edges, Custom folds<\/td>\n<td>Shipping, Heavy products, E-commerce parcels<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Box Styles<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Mailer, Tuck End, Two-Piece, Folding Carton, Die-Cut, Snap Lock, Auto Bottom, Sleeve, Set-Up Box, Gable Box<\/td>\n<td>Kraft Board, SBS Board, Corrugated Sheets<\/td>\n<td>Matte, Gloss, Satin, Spot UV<\/td>\n<td>Window cut-outs, Handles, Magnetic closures<\/td>\n<td>Gift boxes, Retail packaging, Fast food, Cosmetics<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Coating Choices<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Matte, Gloss, Satin, Spot UV, Soft Touch, Aqueous, Varnish, Lamination (Glossy\/Matte), Anti-Scratch<\/td>\n<td>Premium Coated Paper, Food-Safe Lamination<\/td>\n<td>Anti-Scratch, Matte Lamination, Textured UV<\/td>\n<td>Oil &amp; Grease resistance, FDA-safe coatings<\/td>\n<td>Food containers, Cosmetic packaging, Luxury branding<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Custom Inserts<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Kraft Partitions, Foam Inserts, Molded Pulp, Molded Paper, Plastic Trays, Dividers, Corrugated Inserts<\/td>\n<td>Kraft, Recycled Pulp, Plastic (PET\/PP), Foam<\/td>\n<td>Gloss, Matte<\/td>\n<td>Adjustable partitions, Printed liners, Custom die-cuts<\/td>\n<td>Electronics, Glassware, Perfumes, Candles, Fragile goods<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Printing Options<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>No Print (Blank), Single Color, Full Color (CMYK), Spot Colors (Pantone), Inside Printing, Embossing, Debossing, Foil Stamping, Digital, Offset<\/td>\n<td>Eco-Safe Inks, Soy-Based Inks, Pantone Matching System<\/td>\n<td>Matte, Gloss, Spot UV, Soft Touch, Metallic Foils<\/td>\n<td>QR codes, Barcodes, Logo Branding, Raised UV, Inside-outside printing<\/td>\n<td>Branding, Retail, Promotional kits, Subscription boxes<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p data-start=\"2195\" data-end=\"2290\">Our boxes hold up well during transport, resist crushing, and stack efficiently when assembled.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"2292\" data-end=\"2295\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"2297\" data-end=\"2348\">Customization Options with Blank Cardboard Boxes<\/h2>\n<h3 data-start=\"2350\" data-end=\"2392\">Blank Cardboard Boxes Wholesale Orders<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"2394\" data-end=\"2528\">If you&#8217;re sourcing <strong data-start=\"2413\" data-end=\"2448\">blank cardboard boxes wholesale<\/strong>, we make it easy to order in bulk and save on cost without sacrificing quality.<\/p>\n<ol data-start=\"2530\" data-end=\"2676\">\n<li data-start=\"2530\" data-end=\"2568\">\n<p data-start=\"2533\" data-end=\"2568\">Minimum order starts from 100 units<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2569\" data-end=\"2609\">\n<p data-start=\"2572\" data-end=\"2609\">Bulk pricing available for 500+ units<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2610\" data-end=\"2642\">\n<p data-start=\"2613\" data-end=\"2642\">Free shipping within the U.S.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2643\" data-end=\"2676\">\n<p data-start=\"2646\" data-end=\"2676\">Fast production and turnaround<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p data-start=\"2678\" data-end=\"2804\">We support small businesses, subscription brands, e-commerce sellers, and crafters with consistent supply and easy reordering.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"2806\" data-end=\"2809\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"2811\" data-end=\"2855\">Related Styles Like Black Cardboard Boxes<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2857\" data-end=\"3084\">While plain kraft or white boxes are common, we also offer <a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/black-cardboard-boxes\/\"><strong data-start=\"2916\" data-end=\"2941\">Black Cardboard Boxes<\/strong><\/a> as a sleek alternative for premium branding. These boxes are ideal for gift packaging, electronics, cosmetics, or high-end subscription boxes.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3086\" data-end=\"3104\">Black boxes offer:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"3106\" data-end=\"3226\">\n<li data-start=\"3106\" data-end=\"3136\">\n<p data-start=\"3108\" data-end=\"3136\">A clean, modern presentation<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3137\" data-end=\"3178\">\n<p data-start=\"3139\" data-end=\"3178\">High contrast with white or foil labels<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3179\" data-end=\"3226\">\n<p data-start=\"3181\" data-end=\"3226\">Compatibility with Spot UV and matte finishes<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"3228\" data-end=\"3313\">You can explore all black packaging styles under our black cardboard product section.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"3315\" data-end=\"3318\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"3320\" data-end=\"3355\">Popular Uses for Blank Packaging<\/h2>\n<h3 data-start=\"3357\" data-end=\"3401\">Blank Cardboard Boxes Near Me and Beyond<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"3403\" data-end=\"3576\">Whether you are searching for <strong data-start=\"3433\" data-end=\"3466\">blank cardboard boxes near me<\/strong> for a quick pickup or need nationwide shipping, we provide local and U.S.-wide service with fast fulfillment.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3578\" data-end=\"3616\">Our customers use blank packaging for:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"3618\" data-end=\"3747\">\n<li data-start=\"3618\" data-end=\"3647\">\n<p data-start=\"3620\" data-end=\"3647\">E-commerce product shipping<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3648\" data-end=\"3668\">\n<p data-start=\"3650\" data-end=\"3668\">Subscription boxes<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3669\" data-end=\"3684\">\n<p data-start=\"3671\" data-end=\"3684\">Gift wrapping<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3685\" data-end=\"3700\">\n<p data-start=\"3687\" data-end=\"3700\">Seasonal kits<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3701\" data-end=\"3718\">\n<p data-start=\"3703\" data-end=\"3718\">Event giveaways<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3719\" data-end=\"3747\">\n<p data-start=\"3721\" data-end=\"3747\">Moving or storage supplies<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"3749\" data-end=\"3818\">We support all use cases with stock-ready or made-to-order box types.<\/p>\n<h2 data-start=\"3825\" data-end=\"3876\">Types of Cardboard Boxes Based on Their Functionality<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"3878\" data-end=\"4164\">If you\u2019re sorting packaging options based on structure or performance, our <a class=\"cursor-pointer\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product-category\/Cardboard-Boxes-By-Functionality\/\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"3953\" data-end=\"4074\"><strong data-start=\"3954\" data-end=\"3990\">Cardboard Boxes By Functionality<\/strong><\/a>\u00a0 includes mailers, display boxes, folding styles, food-safe containers, and more.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4166\" data-end=\"4241\">You can filter boxes based on strength, closure, usage, or shipping method.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"4243\" data-end=\"4246\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"4248\" data-end=\"4282\">Why Choose Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4284\" data-end=\"4397\">We focus on simplicity, quality, and service. When you order <strong data-start=\"4345\" data-end=\"4380\">blank cardboard boxes wholesale<\/strong>, you\u2019ll receive:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"4399\" data-end=\"4624\">\n<li data-start=\"4399\" data-end=\"4428\">\n<p data-start=\"4401\" data-end=\"4428\">Custom sizes and box styles<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4429\" data-end=\"4477\">\n<p data-start=\"4431\" data-end=\"4477\">Gloss, Matte, or Spot UV finishes (on request)<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4478\" data-end=\"4527\">\n<p data-start=\"4480\" data-end=\"4527\">Free design assistance if adding branding later<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4528\" data-end=\"4560\">\n<p data-start=\"4530\" data-end=\"4560\">Low MOQs starting at 100 units<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4561\" data-end=\"4592\">\n<p data-start=\"4563\" data-end=\"4592\">Bulk pricing for large orders<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4593\" data-end=\"4624\">\n<p data-start=\"4595\" data-end=\"4624\">Free shipping across the U.S.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<hr data-start=\"4626\" data-end=\"4629\" \/>\n<p data-start=\"4631\" data-end=\"4865\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"4631\" data-end=\"4661\">Ready to place your order?<\/strong> Contact us today for a fast quote on blank cardboard boxes. Whether you need plain boxes for shipping or packaging for small-batch products, we\u2019ll make sure your boxes arrive fast, flat, and ready to go.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Our blank cardboard boxes are available in various sizes and styles, perfect for any product. We offer high-quality materials and printing options to ensure your boxes look professional. Plus, our fast turnaround times mean you can get your boxes quickly. Customize your order with options like coatings, design, and shipping. Made with high-quality materials and printing options, our boxes are built to last. Order Now.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":2327,"template":"","meta":{"_joinchat":[]},"product_brand":[],"product_cat":[181],"product_tag":[],"class_list":["post-2233","product","type-product","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","product_cat-cardboard-boxes-by-functionality","rishi-post","first","instock","shipping-taxable","purchasable","product-type-simple"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v27.9 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Order Blank Cardboard Boxes At Wholesale<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Buy high-quality blank cardboard boxes at wholesale prices. Customize size, style, and printing. Fast shipping and free design.\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/blank-cardboard-boxes\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \